d a spontaneous night together and I didn't have to overthink a single thing. And I didn't reach for any pills beforehand!!|I had tried so many things, and as I aged, my performance continued to decline. I decided to give it a try, and I am so glad I did. I am seeing gradual improvement over several weeks, to the point where morning wood is back most days and my energy is steadier than it's been in years. It is working for me. I am convinced. Thank you so much.|I've lost count of the nights I was getting up every hour on the hour. I get up one time now. I keep thinking this is a fluke and I'm going to go back to dragging through the day with zero energy and no drive. So I'm just enjoying one day at a time. Thank you for the discount. God bless you for making something for men like me." | split: "|" -%}
